[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10561.19, "timestamp": "02:56:01", "text": "[音乐] 要做。如果有效，那就有效。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10564.07, "timestamp": "02:56:04", "text": "没关系，它不起作用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10567.51, "timestamp": "02:56:07", "text": "给你看看。我觉得我不会留着它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10572.469, "timestamp": "02:56:12", "text": "永远。或许如果有需求，或者如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10576.07, "timestamp": "02:56:16", "text": "或者如果我负担得起的话。所以，是的，我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10578.71, "timestamp": "02:56:18", "text": "已经吃过晚饭了。好的。我已经有了我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10602.79, "timestamp": "02:56:42", "text": "但这就像你尝试一样，就像一场试验。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10604.07, "timestamp": "02:56:44", "text": "错误。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10607.11, "timestamp": "02:56:47", "text": "我只是想尝试一些东西，但没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10609.99, "timestamp": "02:56:49", "text": "有人以前试过，看看效果如何。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10613.19, "timestamp": "02:56:53", "text": "走了。这是一份很好的学习资料。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10615.67, "timestamp": "02:56:55", "text": "其他人也一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10619.03, "timestamp": "02:56:59", "text": "因为我承担了审判的风险，而且"}]